abstract: "Public web tool that plays NASA SPHEREx images of any patch of sky over time. Super Intelligence (SI) use: SI tools were used to help write and revise code, tests and documentation under the author's direction; the idea, design and testing are the author's own. No SI-generated images, video or audio are used."
title: "SkyShift: A Time Machine for the SPHEREx Sky"
